{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c1b24575-d7ba-8aeb-b3ec-951ade9c805e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T15:40:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. My name is David Wilcox. I am calling because my street, it has not been plowed. Not since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:31:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Which storm are we talking about, the one over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, last weekend, the snow that turned to rain. Started Sunday, went into Monday. Now is Tuesday, and nobody come down our street. Not one time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:32:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Old Beach Road. I am at 24 Old Beach Road. Twenty-four. By Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-four Old Beach Road, okay. Let me write that down. And when you say it hasn't been plowed, is it still snow-covered, or is it that heavy slushy stuff that froze up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:33:07-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is both. Snow first, then rain, then it freeze. Now is hard, like ice with ridges. My car cannot get out of the driveway. I tried this morning, the wheels just spin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:33:29-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that rain on top of the snow made a mess of a lot of streets. Has anything come through at all, even a sander or a pickup with a blade?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:33:51-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Nothing. I am home since yesterday, I work from home, so I see the street. No plow, no sand truck. The neighbor across, same thing. Only tire tracks from people driving, that is all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Hang on one second, I'm just pulling up the plow list so I can see how that area is handled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. Take your time. Sorry, one moment, I am in the middle of a game with my family, board game, so we pause. Everybody is waiting at the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:34:52-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no worries, I'll let you get back to it soon. Alright, I'm looking at the route sheet. Old Beach Road is on the list, so it should get a pass. I don't see a note saying it was done after the storm ended."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:35:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it was not done. Same as what I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's how it looks from here, yes. I'm going to log it as a request for plowing and sanding at twenty-four Old Beach Road, and it goes to the crew supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:35:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Please log it. I want it in the record that I call today, Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:36:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It'll be logged today with the time of your call. Can I get a number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:36:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0155. Zero one five five. Five five five, then zero one five five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:36:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-five. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:36:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:36:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And it's David Wilcox, W-I-L-C-O-X?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, W-I-L-C-O-X. David."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:36:48-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So you've got the road unplowed since Sunday into Monday, ice ridges, and you can't get your car out. Anything else about the street I should add? Is it blocking emergency access, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe is narrow now. Only one car can pass, because the snow bank on the side did not get push back. If ambulance need to come, I think is difficult. But I am not saying emergency now. Just is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, I'll note the narrow lane and the banks along the side. That helps them prioritize."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:37:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And when somebody come? Today? Tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:38:00-05:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a firm hour. Crews are working through the backlog from the rain and freeze, and the main roads go first. Realistically I'd say sometime in the next day or so for a side street, and sooner if the supervisor sees it's bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next day or so. Okay. Is a little long, honestly. Four days with no plow. But okay, I understand you just write it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:38:48-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It's a fair thing to be irritated about. In the meantime, if you've got sand or salt, a little behind the tires might get you moving."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have some salt from the hardware store. I will try this evening. But still the street need plow, my salt cannot fix whole street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:39:26-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, definitely not. That's why I've put it in. If it's still untouched by tomorrow afternoon, call back and give me the same address, and I'll add a follow-up note to this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:39:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow afternoon, okay. Twenty-four Old Beach Road. I will call again if nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:39:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:40:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Denise. I go back to the game now. My daughter is waiting, she is about to win, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go. Have a good evening, Mr. Wilcox."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:40:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
